WEBVTT

00:00:07.622 --> 00:00:09.499
(all gasping, sighing)

00:00:09.582 --> 00:00:12.668
Well, aren't you just full of surprises?
你真是充满惊喜.

00:00:12.752 --> 00:00:14.170
(Ericka chuckles)
你真是充满惊喜.

00:00:14.253 --> 00:00:15.421
That way!
那边!

00:00:15.505 --> 00:00:17.423
♪ ♪

00:00:17.507 --> 00:00:18.925
Johnny?
约翰尼!你在哪里?

00:00:19.008 --> 00:00:20.843
Johnny, where are you?
约翰尼!你在哪里?

00:00:20.927 --> 00:00:22.386
Johnny?
约翰尼?

00:00:25.223 --> 00:00:26.432
(gasps)

00:00:29.393 --> 00:00:31.312
Oh, no.
糟了.

00:00:36.859 --> 00:00:38.861
♪ ♪

00:00:43.241 --> 00:00:45.451
(gasps) Oh, Johnny.
约翰尼.

00:00:45.535 --> 00:00:47.912
(angry grunting, growling)

00:00:47.995 --> 00:00:50.289
Johnny! Johnny, stop!
约翰尼,停止!

00:00:50.373 --> 00:00:51.457
Huh?

00:00:51.541 --> 00:00:52.667
Oh.
梅...?

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:54.585
M... M-M...
梅...?

00:00:54.669 --> 00:00:56.170
Mavis?
梅维丝?

00:00:56.254 --> 00:00:58.005
Yes, honey, it's me.
是的,亲爱的,是我.

00:00:58.089 --> 00:00:59.132
Oh, thank goodness.
感谢上天.我以为我失去了你.

00:00:59.215 --> 00:01:00.591
I thought I lost you.
感谢上天.我以为我失去了你.

00:01:00.675 --> 00:01:03.386
-Mavis!
-I'm so sorry.
我很抱歉.我爸爸不应该骗你.

00:01:03.469 --> 00:01:05.346
My dad never should've lied to you.
我很抱歉.我爸爸不应该骗你.

00:01:05.429 --> 00:01:07.014
-(angry growling)
-(gasps)

00:01:07.098 --> 00:01:09.809
Dracula bad!
德古拉很坏!

00:01:09.892 --> 00:01:11.561
Whoa! Johnny!
哇.约翰尼!

00:01:11.644 --> 00:01:12.854
(gasping)

00:01:12.937 --> 00:01:14.564
(thunder cracks)

00:01:17.024 --> 00:01:18.401
(Ericka gasps)

00:01:18.484 --> 00:01:20.987
OTHERS:
Whoa.
哇.

00:01:25.533 --> 00:01:27.535
♪ ♪

00:01:36.377 --> 00:01:38.212
(steady beeping)

00:01:38.296 --> 00:01:39.380
(gasps)

00:01:39.463 --> 00:01:40.756
That's it.
就是这里.

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:43.259
The crystal is in there.
水晶在里面.

00:01:43.342 --> 00:01:45.636
♪ ♪

00:01:50.433 --> 00:01:53.352
(steady beeping)

00:01:55.396 --> 00:01:58.357
We are getting closer.
我们很接近了.

00:01:58.441 --> 00:02:02.945
...until you reach
the Cave of the Reflexión!
直到你抵达反映山洞!

00:02:03.029 --> 00:02:06.365
Where entering is deadly...
进入可能会致命...

00:02:06.449 --> 00:02:11.162
(echoing):
and escape impossible!
出来更是不可能.

00:02:11.245 --> 00:02:13.331
Okay, we get it!
够了,我们明白!

00:02:13.414 --> 00:02:15.458
Uh, you okay there, honey?
你没事吧,亲爱的?

00:02:15.541 --> 00:02:17.126
Oh, hey. Yes.
没事.一切很好.

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:18.336
Everything is fine.
没事.一切很好.

00:02:18.419 --> 00:02:20.421
(all screaming)
没事.一切很好.

00:02:31.557 --> 00:02:33.392
(all grunt)

00:02:34.602 --> 00:02:36.229
-(whooshing)
-(all screaming)

00:02:41.275 --> 00:02:43.986
-Whoa!
-(screams) Murray!
穆雷!

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:45.363
(screams, blows)

00:02:45.446 --> 00:02:46.864
Rocks!
石头!

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:50.868
(all screaming)

00:02:52.954 --> 00:02:54.205
(screams)

00:02:55.748 --> 00:02:56.999
Uh-oh. Look!

00:03:00.253 --> 00:03:02.546
(all gasping)

00:03:05.967 --> 00:03:07.218
Whoa!

00:03:09.971 --> 00:03:11.847
Whew.

00:03:11.931 --> 00:03:13.849
(grunts)
Mom! Wesley's touching me!
妈,卫斯理碰我!

00:03:13.933 --> 00:03:15.726
She touched me first!
她先碰我!

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:17.311
-(wolf pups whooping, laughing)
-Yeah!

00:03:17.395 --> 00:03:19.063
Oh, my shoes!
啊,我的鞋子!

00:03:19.146 --> 00:03:20.690
Ah, we're going down!
我们要沉了!

00:03:20.773 --> 00:03:22.692
Sorry, Blobs, you're on your own.
对不起,果冻,你要靠自己了.

00:03:22.775 --> 00:03:24.777
I can't swim! I'm afraid of sharks!
我不会游泳!我怕鲨鱼.

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:25.987
Ow! Hey, that's my face!
嘿,那是我的脸!

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:27.905
-Ouch!
-You're stepping on me!
你踩到我了.

00:03:27.989 --> 00:03:29.448
-Get out of my way!
-Ow! Hey!
你踩到我了.

00:03:29.532 --> 00:03:31.158
Get off my h-- Ow!
那是我的头!啊!

00:03:31.242 --> 00:03:33.411
-Ow! Oh! -Stop it! Ow!
-(screams)
停止!

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:36.580
(all screaming)

00:03:36.664 --> 00:03:38.582
-(screaming stops)
-ALL: Huh?

00:03:38.666 --> 00:03:40.293
(steady beeping)

00:03:43.004 --> 00:03:45.047
We found it.
我们找到了.

00:03:45.131 --> 00:03:47.133
♪ ♪

00:03:49.719 --> 00:03:51.137
Let me go first.
让我先去.

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:53.389
No, let me go.
不.让我去.

00:04:12.199 --> 00:04:14.201
♪ ♪

00:04:18.873 --> 00:04:20.875
Wow.
哇.

00:04:20.958 --> 00:04:22.793
JOHNNY:
Dracula mean!
德古拉很无情!

00:04:22.877 --> 00:04:24.879
Dracula liar!
德古拉是骗子!

00:04:24.962 --> 00:04:27.923
(roaring):
Johnny mad!
约翰尼疯了!

00:04:28.007 --> 00:04:30.968
Johnny, please! You have to calm down.
约翰尼,拜托,你必须冷静.

00:04:31.052 --> 00:04:32.636
(screams) Whoa!

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:34.347
(phone ringing)

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:36.682
Sorry, sweetie, got to take this.
对不起,宝贝,必须接这电话.

00:04:36.766 --> 00:04:38.225
(Johnny grunting angrily)

00:04:38.309 --> 00:04:39.435
Ericka?
-艾丽卡? -梅维丝!我们找到水晶洞了.

00:04:39.518 --> 00:04:41.145
ERICKA:
Mavis, we found the crystal cave.
-艾丽卡? -梅维丝!我们找到水晶洞了.

00:04:41.228 --> 00:04:43.314
Oh, that's great news.
那是很好的消息.

00:04:43.397 --> 00:04:45.441
Okay, I'm sending you the location now.
好,我现在把位置发送给你.

00:04:45.524 --> 00:04:46.859
Got it. I'll get him there.
收到了.我会带他去那里.

00:04:46.942 --> 00:04:48.694
Are you sure? Is he close?
你确定吗?他接近吗?

00:04:52.865 --> 00:04:54.700
Yep, pretty close.
是的,蛮接近.

00:04:55.826 --> 00:04:57.453
(grunting)

00:04:57.536 --> 00:04:58.996
Sorry about this, honey.
我很抱歉,亲爱的.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.414
-(roars)
-(grunts)

00:05:00.498 --> 00:05:01.499
Huh?

00:05:01.582 --> 00:05:03.542
(chuckles) Hey, sweetie.
嘿,亲爱的.

00:05:03.626 --> 00:05:04.752
(roars)

00:05:06.379 --> 00:05:08.881
AUTOMATED VOICE:
Starting route to your destination.
出发前往目的地的路线.

00:05:08.964 --> 00:05:09.965
Oh.

00:05:10.049 --> 00:05:11.342
(panting)

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.432
DRACULA:
Okay, everybody,
好了,各位.

00:05:18.516 --> 00:05:20.768
the crystal has to be here somewhere.
水晶一定在这里某处.

00:05:27.358 --> 00:05:32.154
We'll find it as long as we stay focused
and don't get...
我们会找到只要我们专注和不要...

00:05:32.238 --> 00:05:34.240
separated. (sighs)
...分开.

00:05:34.323 --> 00:05:36.033
Drac, where are you?
德拉克?你在哪里?

00:05:36.117 --> 00:05:37.827
Murray, is that you?
穆雷?是你吗?

00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:39.495
FRANK:
Hey, Eunice, where'd you go?
嘿,尤尼斯,你去了哪里?

00:05:39.578 --> 00:05:41.455
I'm right here. Where are you?
我在这里.你在哪里?

00:05:41.539 --> 00:05:44.458
Okay, just calm down. Nobody panic.
好,冷静.大家不要惊慌.

00:05:44.542 --> 00:05:47.586
Guys? Guys, Blobby is freaking out.
大伙们,果冻很害怕.

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:49.630
-MURRAY: So am I.
-Murray?
我也是!

00:05:49.713 --> 00:05:51.424
He's right here. Oh, wait.
他在这里.

00:05:51.507 --> 00:05:53.467
No, false alarm. That's a pointy rock.
等一等.不,假的.那是一个尖石头.

00:05:53.551 --> 00:05:55.219
Guys, Blobby's really losing it!
大伙们,果冻快撑不住了!

00:05:55.302 --> 00:05:57.513
-Stay in one place!
-Frank!
留在一个地方.

00:05:57.596 --> 00:06:00.015
-Where am I?!
-Uh, what's happening?
发生什么事?

00:06:00.099 --> 00:06:01.183
Someone, find me!
快来找我!

00:06:01.267 --> 00:06:03.102
-What do we do?
-Where are we?
-我们怎么办? -我们在哪里?

00:06:03.185 --> 00:06:04.228
We're lost!
我们迷失了!

00:06:04.311 --> 00:06:06.564
How do we get out of here?!
我们要如何出去?

00:06:06.647 --> 00:06:08.607
(roaring)

00:06:13.154 --> 00:06:15.197
(panting, grunting)

00:06:15.281 --> 00:06:16.574
Which way?
哪一边?

00:06:16.657 --> 00:06:18.617
AUTOMATED VOICE:
Sorry, I didn't quite get that.
对不起,我听不清楚.

00:06:18.701 --> 00:06:20.494
Calculating new route.
重新计算路线.

00:06:20.578 --> 00:06:21.787
(growling)
急转左.

00:06:21.871 --> 00:06:23.122
Make a sharp left.
急转左.

00:06:27.251 --> 00:06:28.836
Whoa!

00:06:30.045 --> 00:06:31.839
(grunts)

00:06:34.175 --> 00:06:36.385
(grunts, gasps)

00:06:36.469 --> 00:06:38.721
AUTOMATED VOICE:
Your destination is on the right.
您的目的地在右边.

00:06:40.055 --> 00:06:41.474
(panting)

00:06:41.557 --> 00:06:43.392
(growling)

00:06:47.104 --> 00:06:49.231
Okay, honey, just wait here.
好,亲爱的,在这里等.我很快回来.

00:06:49.315 --> 00:06:50.483
I'll be right back.
好,亲爱的,在这里等.我很快回来.

00:06:54.737 --> 00:06:56.739
(fierce growling)

